```jsx
function UserCard() {
  // clear user-specific UI
}

function ProductCard() {
  // clear product-specific UI
}
```

A developer decides to “DRY it up” immediately:

```jsx
function UniversalCard({
  mode,
  compact,
  showBadge,
  titlePosition,
  footerMode,
  kind,
  // ...
}) {
  // many branches
}
```

Fewer files do not automatically mean less complexity.

